   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=104602 day=85 vid=gen_bdythac kind=guard-hear pick="[goon] \"Yeah?\"" triggerPick="[teach] \"Here, I know this one — let me show you.\"" prevThem="You show them Bissap Hibiscus — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
